    "verification": "Strict report hashes and path confinement; fresh cache; every indexed key/payload/kind/provenance compared with an independent provider pass; complete timeline traversal in 2,000-row pages; instruction filter; first/last instruction details and 34-cell register states; first-instruction call-tree page; first-memory state up to 64 bytes. Close and restart the service, reopen persisted cache, repeat all checks, require equal evidence.",
